  <article class="post-content">
    <p>A therapist came to us last month. She wasn't looking for a website redesign. She was looking for a way to stop bleeding money.</p>
    
    <p>Six different tools. Six different logins. Six different monthly bills. Website hosting, scheduling software, email marketing, a payment processor, a client portal, and intake forms — none of them talking to each other.</p>

    <p>On top of $185/month in SaaS fees, her payment processor was taking a hefty cut of every session. She was bleeding money from every direction and didn't even realize how much.</p>

    <p>Between the disconnected subscriptions and the processing costs, she was losing over <strong>$1,000/month</strong> — money that should have been in her pocket.</p>

    <div class="fee-comparison">
      <div class="fee-box before">
